# 44
#title feat: use the skill linker's repo as the skills catalogue
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/44
#branch feat/skill-linker-catalogue
#base main
#opened 2026-11-12
#head cad9c9fd9621af3c7ddfb797816361dc676945d7
#describe what The Skills window takes its catalogue from the skill linker when no repo is saved, so Project skills lists and links its skills and Lantern skills finds them.
#describe what Skills not installed in the project are marked, attaching one links it first, and attached missing skills get a Link to project button.
#describe what The linker status reads as plain words with the skill and role counts.
#describe before With a linker set and no saved repo, Project skills showed only a notice and a button to another tab, and web-research could not be found.
#describe after Project skills lists the linker's roles, the notice with no linker holds the linker path field, and searching web finds web-research as Not installed.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, the full unit suite and the skills Electron spec pass; the new unit test and e2e scenarios fail on the base.
